sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as Automation/Quartz
    participant Engine as ConsolidationEngine
    participant Sources as SourceRegistry
    participant Canon as CanonicalizationEngine
    participant Feature as FeatureExtractor
    participant Cluster as Clusterer
    participant Graph as RelationDetector
    participant Store as MemoryStore
    participant Projection as ProjectionManager
    participant Review as HumanReviewQueue
    participant Report as ReportStorage

    Scheduler->>Engine: Start consolidation(project, profile)
    Engine->>Sources: Find changed sources by hash
    Sources-->>Engine: Source delta
    Engine->>Canon: Canonicalize changed items
    Canon-->>Engine: Canonical records
    Engine->>Feature: Extract semantic/spatial/graph features
    Feature-->>Engine: Feature records
    Engine->>Cluster: Run multi-view clustering
    Cluster-->>Engine: Cluster candidates
    Engine->>Graph: Detect relations/contradictions/supersession
    Graph-->>Engine: Relation proposals
    Engine->>Store: Upsert memory items and safe relations
    Store-->>Engine: Stored memory ids
    Engine->>Review: Create review tasks for risky/ambiguous items
    Review-->>Engine: Review ids
    Engine->>Projection: Rebuild/update Qdrant projections
    Projection-->>Engine: Projection status
    Engine->>Report: Store consolidation report
    Report-->>Engine: Report path
    Engine-->>Scheduler: Consolidation result
